These tools will help our team communicate efficiently and keep track of project progress during the semester.

## Challenges

Since this was my first time using several of these collaboration tools together, it took some time to understand how they work. I needed to learn how GitHub repositories, Trello boards and Slack complement each other during software development.

After exploring each platform, I became more confident in using them for teamwork.

## Reflection

This week's activities showed me that successful software development depends not only on programming skills but also on effective communication and teamwork. Using GitHub, Trello and Slack together helps teams organise tasks, manage code changes and communicate efficiently.

I believe these collaboration skills will be valuable throughout this project and in future professional software development environments.

